(5086211, 741685, 78021, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and subject, but think the speedlight behind the post takes away from it.  Maybe if it was geled to a color that matched the sky color?</td>', 'Love the composition and subject, but think the speedlight behind the post takes away from it.  Maybe if it was geled to a color that matched the sky color?', '2008-11-26 16:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
