(5086241, 741114, 88204, '<td valign="top">Backlighting works great on this shot. I like how it highlights the whiskers. It also keep the eyes very mysterious.</td>', 'Backlighting works great on this shot. I like how it highlights the whiskers. It also keep the eyes very mysterious.', '2008-11-26 16:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
