(5086272, 740780, 43774, '<td valign="top">Who would have thought that a basket would make such an interesting photo? See, lighting makes all the difference.</td>', 'Who would have thought that a basket would make such an interesting photo? See, lighting makes all the difference.', '2008-11-26 16:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5086276, 741224, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the outline of light on the hat and face, as well as the way it highlights the character in the hands. Very moody. One thing that could have been cool would be to include a lit cigarette in his mouth. Backlit smoke could really add to the atmosphere (of course this would be silly if this piano player doesn''t smoke, but it it''s a model, it would add to the mood.) One of my favorites so far!</td>', 'I love the outline of light on the hat and face, as well as the way it highlights the character in the hands. Very moody. One thing that could have been cool would be to include a lit cigarette in his mouth. Backlit smoke could really add to the atmosphere (of course this would be silly if this piano player doesn''t smoke, but it it''s a model, it would add to the mood.) One of my favorites so far!', '2008-11-26 16:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5086277, 740892, 43774, '<td valign="top">And he''s glowing! Very cute.</td>', 'And he''s glowing! Very cute.', '2008-11-26 16:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5086278, 741324, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice, I love backlit leaves. Good detail.</td>', 'Nice, I love backlit leaves. Good detail.', '2008-11-26 16:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5086279, 741998, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good job on the backlighting, pretty glow to this.</td>', 'Good job on the backlighting, pretty glow to this.', '2008-11-26 16:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5086280, 742141, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice, very nice, but the description reads:<br/> <br/>"The subject should not become a silhouette because of the backlighting"</td>', 'Nice, very nice, but the description reads: "The subject should not become a silhouette because of the backlighting"', '2008-11-26 16:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5086281, 741460, 43774, '<td valign="top">A water globe, is it? It''s a very interesting photo, love your choice of background colour.</td>', 'A water globe, is it? It''s a very interesting photo, love your choice of background colour.', '2008-11-26 16:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5086282, 741099, 43774, '<td valign="top">Great colours, wondering why you put it in a bowl. I think the globe would have been great on its own.</td>', 'Great colours, wondering why you put it in a bowl. I think the globe would have been great on its own.', '2008-11-26 16:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
