(5088207, 741238, 68178, '<td valign="top">I didn''t realize this wasn''t a silhouette until I saw it on a lighter monitor. Maybe brighten it a touch (or maybe I should calibrate my monitor heh).</td>', 'I didn''t realize this wasn''t a silhouette until I saw it on a lighter monitor. Maybe brighten it a touch (or maybe I should calibrate my monitor heh).', '2008-11-28 09:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088209, 741917, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the way you used the back lighting.  Two things I might change: 1) Crop a little closer to minimize the black background.  You need some of it to contrast with the petals but not any more than necessary.  2) Put just a little light on the center of the flour (lower left) for the same reason.  Just my opinion.  6</td>', 'I like the colors and the way you used the back lighting.  Two things I might change: 1) Crop a little closer to minimize the black background.  You need some of it to contrast with the petals but not any more than necessary.  2) Put just a little light on the center of the flour (lower left) for the same reason.  Just my opinion.  6', '2008-11-28 09:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088212, 741883, 68178, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Mot sure its really visually appealing as it stands though. Maybe a larger more pronounced wave or a lower point of view?</td>', 'Interesting idea. Mot sure its really visually appealing as it stands though. Maybe a larger more pronounced wave or a lower point of view?', '2008-11-28 09:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088215, 741829, 68178, '<td valign="top">Is it a fruit x-ray?</td>', 'Is it a fruit x-ray?', '2008-11-28 09:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088216, 742138, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  I like the way the upper stem sort of fades into the background and the upper flower is sort of floating.  If you could have moved the upper flower to the right just a bit, the two of them would have been at "rule of thirds" intersections.  6</td>', 'Nice lighting.  I like the way the upper stem sort of fades into the background and the upper flower is sort of floating.  If you could have moved the upper flower to the right just a bit, the two of them would have been at "rule of thirds" intersections.  6', '2008-11-28 09:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088217, 740905, 68178, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how you could control it better, but the composition hurts this image. It''s a tad cluttered.</td>', 'I''m not sure how you could control it better, but the composition hurts this image. It''s a tad cluttered.', '2008-11-28 09:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088218, 740441, 29513, '<td valign="top">Wow, I hope that is a long lens or you are quick on your feet.  :)  The only thing I can think of to change would be maybe the nearly square crop.  Very nice work.  7</td>', 'Wow, I hope that is a long lens or you are quick on your feet.  :)  The only thing I can think of to change would be maybe the nearly square crop.  Very nice work.  7', '2008-11-28 09:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088220, 741570, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the spot light effect.  I might have tried some more general lighting from the lower left side.  Also, I find the bright place just to the lower right of the buttons a bit distracting.  5</td>', 'I like the spot light effect.  I might have tried some more general lighting from the lower left side.  Also, I find the bright place just to the lower right of the buttons a bit distracting.  5', '2008-11-28 09:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088222, 741635, 29513, '<td valign="top">It is hard for me to get this good of an exposure on white or black animals.  Nice job.  I might have tried cropping a bit closer both to minimize the background and to get away from the squareish cropping. 5</td>', 'It is hard for me to get this good of an exposure on white or black animals.  Nice job.  I might have tried cropping a bit closer both to minimize the background and to get away from the squareish cropping. 5', '2008-11-28 09:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088223, 741634, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and I like the way the center of the flower is not so underexposed that it isn''t visible.  I might have kept the shape of the crop but closed it in on the left and the bottom still keeping the flower toward the upper right.  6 ;)</td>', 'Nice colors and I like the way the center of the flower is not so underexposed that it isn''t visible.  I might have kept the shape of the crop but closed it in on the left and the bottom still keeping the flower toward the upper right.  6 ;)', '2008-11-28 09:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088225, 742008, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject.  I really like to shoot glass with back lighting.  I little light from one side from the front would have kept the center from falling into such deep underexposure.  Even if all the glass is clear, some direct lighting can add a lot.  5</td>', 'Nice choice of subject.  I really like to shoot glass with back lighting.  I little light from one side from the front would have kept the center from falling into such deep underexposure.  Even if all the glass is clear, some direct lighting can add a lot.  5', '2008-11-28 09:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088226, 741899, 29513, '<td valign="top">Mot much to comment on here.  Not a thing I would change. 10</td>', 'Mot much to comment on here.  Not a thing I would change. 10', '2008-11-28 09:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088235, 740544, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice subdued colors.  I might have cropped a bit closer to minimize the empty black space.  There might be some interesting negative space interplay between the edges of the leaves and the edges of the image if the leaves filled more of the space.  Also, I might have changed things so the point where the stems come together is near the lower left corner.  You almost have the "leading lines" thing going on as it is.  6</td>', 'Nice subdued colors.  I might have cropped a bit closer to minimize the empty black space.  There might be some interesting negative space interplay between the edges of the leaves and the edges of the image if the leaves filled more of the space.  Also, I might have changed things so the point where the stems come together is near the lower left corner.  You almost have the "leading lines" thing going on as it is.  6', '2008-11-28 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088242, 742025, 29513, '<td valign="top">What a lovely smile!  I like the way her hair frames the lovely shape of her face.  Her hair sort of fades into the sky a bit at the upper right.  I might have tried a closer crop.  5</td>', 'What a lovely smile!  I like the way her hair frames the lovely shape of her face.  Her hair sort of fades into the sky a bit at the upper right.  I might have tried a closer crop.  5', '2008-11-28 09:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088247, 742095, 29513, '<td valign="top">I think you have a good exposure on the angel.  I might have cropped so that the angle is not in the center of the shot.  In fact, the spot on the left where the back light falls on the surface is a bit distracting so I might have cropped it out.  5</td>', 'I think you have a good exposure on the angel.  I might have cropped so that the angle is not in the center of the shot.  In fact, the spot on the left where the back light falls on the surface is a bit distracting so I might have cropped it out.  5', '2008-11-28 09:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088251, 741636, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like your use of back lighting here.  It really draws the subject.  The direct lighting is too warm, in my opinion, though.</td>', 'I like your use of back lighting here.  It really draws the subject.  The direct lighting is too warm, in my opinion, though.', '2008-11-28 09:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088286, 741854, 68178, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the challenge. Excellent shot!</td>', 'This is my favorite of the challenge. Excellent shot!', '2008-11-28 10:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088288, 740791, 68178, '<td valign="top">This is quite a different take on the challenge.Well done!</td>', 'This is quite a different take on the challenge.Well done!', '2008-11-28 10:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088297, 741956, 89341, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice idea but there are a few things wrong IMHO<br/>The image could be a bit bigger, 640px, which would allow more detail.<br/>The image can be 150kb which will also allow more detail, try altering the compression % when saving or the "save for web" if using photoshop.<br/>The focus is off, the bright sun will make it hard for the camera to auto focus, you could try moving the camera around until it focus''s correctly.<br/>You could have got lower and blocked the sun with the flower which may have worked better.</td>', 'It''s a nice idea but there are a few things wrong IMHOThe image could be a bit bigger, 640px, which would allow more detail.The image can be 150kb which will also allow more detail, try altering the compression % when saving or the "save for web" if using photoshop.The focus is off, the bright sun will make it hard for the camera to auto focus, you could try moving the camera around until it focus''s correctly.You could have got lower and blocked the sun with the flower which may have worked better.', '2008-11-28 10:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088301, 742121, 89341, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the glass (or whatever) you shot through has taken all the focus away. The bar running across the top and the tv in the background are too distracting too. Always make sure you look around the shot before pressing the shutter :)</td>', 'Unfortunately the glass (or whatever) you shot through has taken all the focus away. The bar running across the top and the tv in the background are too distracting too. Always make sure you look around the shot before pressing the shutter :)', '2008-11-28 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088303, 740781, 89341, '<td valign="top">A messy room doesn''t make for an interesting photo IMHO</td>', 'A messy room doesn''t make for an interesting photo IMHO', '2008-11-28 10:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088305, 742144, 89341, '<td valign="top">The focus is too out on this.</td>', 'The focus is too out on this.', '2008-11-28 10:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088306, 740580, 89341, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose from the dog but it is side lit? I think it may have worked better not cropping the dogs legs off</td>', 'Interesting pose from the dog but it is side lit? I think it may have worked better not cropping the dogs legs off', '2008-11-28 10:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088309, 741004, 89341, '<td valign="top">not sure how this is backlit? IMHO backlighting should add something to the shot. The focus is good but the subject is not that exciting to me</td>', 'not sure how this is backlit? IMHO backlighting should add something to the shot. The focus is good but the subject is not that exciting to me', '2008-11-28 10:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
