(5088314, 741473, 89341, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it''s the processing but the statue looks odd. I would have also put the statue on the right so the face would be looking into the photo and not out of it.</td>', 'I don''t know if it''s the processing but the statue looks odd. I would have also put the statue on the right so the face would be looking into the photo and not out of it.', '2008-11-28 10:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
