(5088319, 740984, 89341, '<td valign="top">The balloon is just too small in the shot IMHO. Also you have used a bit too much compression when saving the image, your shot is 75kb and it could be 150kb which is why the sky looks a little pixelated</td>', 'The balloon is just too small in the shot IMHO. Also you have used a bit too much compression when saving the image, your shot is 75kb and it could be 150kb which is why the sky looks a little pixelated', '2008-11-28 10:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088320, 740808, 89341, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I have a good suggestion to make this shot better, maybe a lower angle shooting up ... the bright kit kat sign gets way too much of my attention. You did quite well with the lighting</td>', 'I''m not sure I have a good suggestion to make this shot better, maybe a lower angle shooting up ... the bright kit kat sign gets way too much of my attention. You did quite well with the lighting', '2008-11-28 10:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
