(5088339, 740791, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the strong perspective and the lighting.  Usually I find borders pretty neutral but in this case I think it detracts from this particular image.  7</td>', 'I like the strong perspective and the lighting.  Usually I find borders pretty neutral but in this case I think it detracts from this particular image.  7', '2008-11-28 10:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
