(5088428, 742044, 100385, '<td valign="top">Would of been cool with a little front feel and to make the backlight more natural i.e. place the model on a roof top and have the sun behind her. Nice idea though but a little too staged for my taste.<br/> <br/>p.s. The light is where my eyes go to straight away and I''m sure that was not your intention seeing as her upper body is more interesting.<br/> <br/>p.p.s some subtle dodging and burning on that silk dress would of great.</td>', 'Would of been cool with a little front feel and to make the backlight more natural i.e. place the model on a roof top and have the sun behind her. Nice idea though but a little too staged for my taste. p.s. The light is where my eyes go to straight away and I''m sure that was not your intention seeing as her upper body is more interesting. p.p.s some subtle dodging and burning on that silk dress would of great.', '2008-11-28 11:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
