(5089428, 740794, 97225, '<td valign="top">What a charmer. I love the way the backlighting gives him an outline that allows him to stand out against a background which almost matches him in colour. Also you have captured his features to perfection as well. 10</td>', 'What a charmer. I love the way the backlighting gives him an outline that allows him to stand out against a background which almost matches him in colour. Also you have captured his features to perfection as well. 10', '2008-11-29 00:04:34.000000', NULL, 1);
