(5090267, 741922, 94815, '<td valign="top">Pretty paper staging and technically fine. This image is one of the few that relies on backlighting for its impact.</td>', 'Pretty paper staging and technically fine. This image is one of the few that relies on backlighting for its impact.', '2008-11-29 12:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
