(5091941, 741578, 75532, '<td valign="top">I really love this picture.  I am sure it will go unoticed.  I don''t knwo what the writting means.  But this could be someone riding away from the love of their life looking out a taxi window, at the streets flying by, in the rain, in the middle of the night - thats the feeling I get from this photo.  10</td>', 'I really love this picture.  I am sure it will go unoticed.  I don''t knwo what the writting means.  But this could be someone riding away from the love of their life looking out a taxi window, at the streets flying by, in the rain, in the middle of the night - thats the feeling I get from this photo.  10', '2008-11-30 21:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091943, 741854, 75532, '<td valign="top">I really love this image.  However, the title kind of killed it for me for some reason.  I love the wings, the old hands, the landing bird, but that title .... 6</td>', 'I really love this image.  However, the title kind of killed it for me for some reason.  I love the wings, the old hands, the landing bird, but that title .... 6', '2008-11-30 21:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
