(5100468, 741012, 68504, '<td valign="top">Amber geese.  Very fun.</td>', 'Amber geese.  Very fun.', '2008-12-03 02:13:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5100469, 742097, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>beautiful backlighting, wonderfully composed, nicely converted to b/w, and the specular highlights as bokeh add such a nice element to this image</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!beautiful backlighting, wonderfully composed, nicely converted to b/w, and the specular highlights as bokeh add such a nice element to this image', '2008-12-03 02:14:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5100471, 742054, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>masterfully executed exposure, wonderful tone and texture, and dramatic, imposing composition</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!masterfully executed exposure, wonderful tone and texture, and dramatic, imposing composition', '2008-12-03 02:15:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5100476, 742150, 68504, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is good.</td>', 'Yes, this is good.', '2008-12-03 02:16:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5100478, 740478, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/>luminous image of a luminous model, superbly done!</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER!luminous image of a luminous model, superbly done!', '2008-12-03 02:16:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5100480, 741548, 28742, '<td valign="top">You got hammered by the anti-silhouette nazis! :) Still good to see you back in the game!</td>', 'You got hammered by the anti-silhouette nazis! :) Still good to see you back in the game!', '2008-12-03 02:19:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5100489, 741899, 79955, '<td valign="top">aww !!! with a D50. Can''t believe the clarity. Awesome processing &amp; lighting. Congrats Irene!!</td>', 'aww !!! with a D50. Can''t believe the clarity. Awesome processing & lighting. Congrats Irene!!', '2008-12-03 02:24:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5100492, 741922, 11467, '<td valign="top">I was pleased with how this image came out.<br/>Thanks for the comments &amp; good votes.<br/>A lot of low votes on this one. 20 under 5. Quite a flat curve.<br/>I started with another concept which didn''t work &amp; proceeded to this.<br/>Here are a couple of outtakes.<br/><a href="//www.peterhansenfoto.de/singapore/index.php?gallery=Sessions/2008/11%20November/Paper" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">More can be seen in my gallery here.</a> <br/> <br/>1.<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.peterhansenfoto.de/singapore/galleries/Sessions/2008/11%20November/Paper/8772Back_Light_sm.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.peterhansenfoto.de/singapore/galleries/Sessions/2008/11%20November/Paper/8772Back_Light_sm.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.peterhansenfoto.de/singapore/galleries/Sessions/2008/11%20November/Paper/8772Back_Light_sm.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>2.<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.peterhansenfoto.de/singapore/galleries/Sessions/2008/11%20November/Paper/8797Back_Light_sm.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.peterhansenfoto.de/singapore/galleries/Sessions/2008/11%20November/Paper/8797Back_Light_sm.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.peterhansenfoto.de/singapore/galleries/Sessions/2008/11%20November/Paper/8797Back_Light_sm.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>3. I nearly used this one as I thought it would show the back lighting better.<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.peterhansenfoto.de/singapore/galleries/Sessions/2008/11%20November/Paper/8800Back_Light_sm.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.peterhansenfoto.de/singapore/galleries/Sessions/2008/11%20November/Paper/8800Back_Light_sm.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.peterhansenfoto.de/singapore/galleries/Sessions/2008/11%20November/Paper/8800Back_Light_sm.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>4. For those who like bright colours.<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.peterhansenfoto.de/singapore/galleries/Sessions/2008/11%20November/Paper/8803Back_Light_sm.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.peterhansenfoto.de/singapore/galleries/Sessions/2008/11%20November/Paper/8803Back_Light_sm.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.peterhansenfoto.de/singapore/galleries/Sessions/2008/11%20November/Paper/8803Back_Light_sm.jpg"/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-03 02:27:25.</i></td>', 'I was pleased with how this image came out.Thanks for the comments & good votes.A lot of low votes on this one. 20 under 5. Quite a flat curve.I started with another concept which didn''t work & proceeded to this.Here are a couple of outtakes.More can be seen in my gallery here.  1.  2.  3. I nearly used this one as I thought it would show the back lighting better.  4. For those who like bright colours.', '2008-12-03 02:26:15.000000', '2008-12-03 02:27:25.000000', 0),
(5100506, 741922, 68956, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually enjoy DPC style studio set up shots, but for this and the others you''ve shown I will definitely make an exception. Your images work well as art and I''ve loved looking at them, thank you :)</td>', 'I don''t usually enjoy DPC style studio set up shots, but for this and the others you''ve shown I will definitely make an exception. Your images work well as art and I''ve loved looking at them, thank you :)', '2008-12-03 02:38:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5100517, 741899, 91360, '<td valign="top">Awesome processing &amp; lighting, a little over sharpened.<br/>I really like this angel.<br/>this was my favorit.</td>', 'Awesome processing & lighting, a little over sharpened.I really like this angel.this was my favorit.', '2008-12-03 02:48:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5100521, 742039, 48936, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon!  I love the lighting effect.  Be my guest, and upload it to the inspirational photos section on my new site, <a href="//www.insidelooknetwork.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Inside Look Network</a>.</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon!  I love the lighting effect.  Be my guest, and upload it to the inspirational photos section on my new site, Inside Look Network.', '2008-12-03 02:50:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5100548, 741854, 21124, '<td valign="top">Wow! Cross-process, flare, visible grain, and you still won a ribbon here on DPC. I hope this is an ongoing trend here.<br/> <br/>The pic itself:<br/>The backlighting on pigeons and on the hand''s hair convey the feeling of a low rise winter sun, accentuated by the cold colors of the cross process. Overall, this convey a peacefull moody feeling, which is quite an achievment considering that it was probably full of pigeons freneticly flying everywhere.</td>', 'Wow! Cross-process, flare, visible grain, and you still won a ribbon here on DPC. I hope this is an ongoing trend here. The pic itself:The backlighting on pigeons and on the hand''s hair convey the feeling of a low rise winter sun, accentuated by the cold colors of the cross process. Overall, this convey a peacefull moody feeling, which is quite an achievment considering that it was probably full of pigeons freneticly flying everywhere.', '2008-12-03 03:05:09.000000', NULL, 0),
