(5100645, 741933, 76162, '<td valign="top">Thanks for comments!<br/> <br/>Since aKiwi already commented maybe there is no need for this, but...it seems for some of you the image is too silhouetted and for others it looks like side lighting rather than backlighting?<br/>I forgot to write photographer''s comments so here they are -  black background, one softbox directly next to it (~20 cm behind), body is slightly turned toward the light so it doesnt become silhouette.<br/>Its just a low key photo, if I used reflector or another light the caracter of the image would change.<br/> <br/>aKiwi thank you for encouraging words! (took a look at your profile - there are some great images in it)</td>', 'Thanks for comments! Since aKiwi already commented maybe there is no need for this, but...it seems for some of you the image is too silhouetted and for others it looks like side lighting rather than backlighting?I forgot to write photographer''s comments so here they are -  black background, one softbox directly next to it (~20 cm behind), body is slightly turned toward the light so it doesnt become silhouette.Its just a low key photo, if I used reflector or another light the caracter of the image would change. aKiwi thank you for encouraging words! (took a look at your profile - there are some great images in it)', '2008-12-03 04:59:12.000000', NULL, 0),
