(5106075, 741933, 76162, '<td valign="top">I used G5 because at the moment its the only camera I have IR remote for and I was both the model and photographer on this one.<br/>Fired the strobe with Elinchrom Skyport trigger.<br/>G5 is ok to shoot with, it has decent manual controls, raw file format, hot shoe...the lens is not that hot but in this case it turned out fine.<br/> <br/>Calliope thanks for your compliments on my breasts :)))</td>', 'I used G5 because at the moment its the only camera I have IR remote for and I was both the model and photographer on this one.Fired the strobe with Elinchrom Skyport trigger.G5 is ok to shoot with, it has decent manual controls, raw file format, hot shoe...the lens is not that hot but in this case it turned out fine. Calliope thanks for your compliments on my breasts :)))', '2008-12-04 14:34:47.000000', NULL, 0),
