(5106327, 741927, 67145, '<td valign="top">i love it when you get shadows on petals or grass or stuff like that from behind .. its a great look .. the more i look at this the better i like it .. the clarity and lighting on the lower flower at its centre is stunning .. the colours are so natural and delicate .. a very beautiful image enzo .. like WOW .. !!!..:)</td>', 'i love it when you get shadows on petals or grass or stuff like that from behind .. its a great look .. the more i look at this the better i like it .. the clarity and lighting on the lower flower at its centre is stunning .. the colours are so natural and delicate .. a very beautiful image enzo .. like WOW .. !!!..:)', '2008-12-04 16:10:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5106662, 741933, 61396, '<td valign="top">"Silhouette - A view of an object or scene consisting of the outline and a featureless interior". <br/> <br/>Featureless? Far, far from it!</td>', '"Silhouette - A view of an object or scene consisting of the outline and a featureless interior".  Featureless? Far, far from it!', '2008-12-04 18:25:15.000000', NULL, 0),
