(5112399, 741854, 22459, '<td valign="top">A lovely back-lit image that brings to mind thoughts of a distant time and place yet it could be in your local park. A rare thing for DPC, an image that tells many stories, has no oversaturated color.. and it has a ribbon? Is this a change of the guard here?</td>', 'A lovely back-lit image that brings to mind thoughts of a distant time and place yet it could be in your local park. A rare thing for DPC, an image that tells many stories, has no oversaturated color.. and it has a ribbon? Is this a change of the guard here?', '2008-12-06 16:33:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5112743, 741899, 89230, '<td valign="top">This photo, I will tell you, this photo is absolutely the worst examples that I have seen of one of an imitation of one of my pathetic (and failing) attempts at some kind of beautiful photography (AKA: Good Job and congratulations on your blue ribbon!!).</td>', 'This photo, I will tell you, this photo is absolutely the worst examples that I have seen of one of an imitation of one of my pathetic (and failing) attempts at some kind of beautiful photography (AKA: Good Job and congratulations on your blue ribbon!!).', '2008-12-06 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5112756, 741854, 89230, '<td valign="top">....and then the doves attacked the man, pecking his eyeballs and eating him to the bone. After they had gorged themselves, the person that voted this a 1 dropped dead, and the doves pooped all over him/her. <br/> <br/>Congrats!</td>', '....and then the doves attacked the man, pecking his eyeballs and eating him to the bone. After they had gorged themselves, the person that voted this a 1 dropped dead, and the doves pooped all over him/her.  Congrats!', '2008-12-06 19:45:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5112759, 742039, 89230, '<td valign="top">I am going to have to agree with the people that voted this a 3, 4, and a 5. Because when i see this photo, I think: Junk. NOT!!! This is a great photo. I really enjoyed seeing this, and hope that in the future I will be able to take your idea and take a similar photo so I can add it to my portfolio. Love it!<br/> <br/>Congratulations!</td>', 'I am going to have to agree with the people that voted this a 3, 4, and a 5. Because when i see this photo, I think: Junk. NOT!!! This is a great photo. I really enjoyed seeing this, and hope that in the future I will be able to take your idea and take a similar photo so I can add it to my portfolio. Love it! Congratulations!', '2008-12-06 19:48:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5112760, 742138, 89230, '<td valign="top">fantastic idea and photo. I really like the lighting. Next time I recommend you Hunting down the people who voted you a 2, 3, 4, and 5, and break their fingers to they cant vote. Truly, I love the content and the lighting. Congrats on the H.M.</td>', 'fantastic idea and photo. I really like the lighting. Next time I recommend you Hunting down the people who voted you a 2, 3, 4, and 5, and break their fingers to they cant vote. Truly, I love the content and the lighting. Congrats on the H.M.', '2008-12-06 19:50:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5112819, 741899, 82817, '<td valign="top">Incredible water droplet photo. You nailed this one and there is such a great deal of detail in the image. Way to go and congratulations on the Blue!</td>', 'Incredible water droplet photo. You nailed this one and there is such a great deal of detail in the image. Way to go and congratulations on the Blue!', '2008-12-06 20:46:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5113213, 741854, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Congrats on the high placement. <br/> <br/>Would you be willing to explain this?: "Chose a 14:9 style crop to give it more of a cross-processed dramatic feel." How does that work exactly?</td>', 'Beautiful! Congrats on the high placement.  Would you be willing to explain this?: "Chose a 14:9 style crop to give it more of a cross-processed dramatic feel." How does that work exactly?', '2008-12-06 23:58:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5113466, 741854, 101370, '<td valign="top">GREAT...</td>', 'GREAT...', '2008-12-07 04:24:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5113893, 741854, 8860, '<td valign="top">Thanks once again for some heartwarming comments - appreciate it.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful! Congrats on the high placement. <br/> <br/>Would you be willing to explain this?: "Chose a 14:9 style crop to give it more of a cross-processed dramatic feel." How does that work exactly? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What I meant was that I cropped it to a 14:9 ratio, similar to the compromise crop ratio used in movies-for-TV conversion, to give a cinematic edge to it. My grammar was not good here and the x-process bit was irrelevant in context of cropping, but was useful in giving it that urban, gritty dramatic vibe, such as in the film ''Kes'' or ''Nil by Mouth'' perhaps.<br/>[edited for typo in grammar!]<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-07 18:40:48.</i></td>', 'Thanks once again for some heartwarming comments - appreciate it. Originally posted by bvy: Beautiful! Congrats on the high placement.  Would you be willing to explain this?: "Chose a 14:9 style crop to give it more of a cross-processed dramatic feel." How does that work exactly?   What I meant was that I cropped it to a 14:9 ratio, similar to the compromise crop ratio used in movies-for-TV conversion, to give a cinematic edge to it. My grammar was not good here and the x-process bit was irrelevant in context of cropping, but was useful in giving it that urban, gritty dramatic vibe, such as in the film ''Kes'' or ''Nil by Mouth'' perhaps.[edited for typo in grammar!]', '2008-12-07 12:40:03.000000', '2008-12-07 18:40:48.000000', 0),
(5113946, 741922, 90495, '<td valign="top">Lovely image and great composition to it. Well thought out and executed. Very deserving of its top5 spot.</td>', 'Lovely image and great composition to it. Well thought out and executed. Very deserving of its top5 spot.', '2008-12-07 13:11:04.000000', NULL, 0),
